@startuml sd_us226
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
title US226 - Sequence Diagram
autonumber
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam maxMessageSize 260
actor "Maintenance Technician" as Actor
participant "Entry (Envoy)\nvirtual IP of aircraft-maintenance" as EAM
box "aircraft-maintenance-n (the replica that answers)" #F7F7F7
participant "MaintenanceController" as MaintenanceController
participant "CreateMaintenancePartUseCase" as CreateMaintenancePartUseCase
participant "UpdateMaintenancePartUseCase" as UpdateMaintenancePartUseCase
participant "DeleteMaintenancePartUseCase" as DeleteMaintenancePartUseCase
participant "SearchMaintenancePartUseCase" as SearchMaintenancePartUseCase
database "own database" as DBAM
participant "Outbox dispatcher" as OBAM
end box
collections "peer replicas\naircraft-maintenance-m" as PAM
== POST /api/maintenance/parts ==
Actor -> EAM : POST /api/maintenance/parts\n(HTTPS, Authorization: Bearer JWT)
EAM -> MaintenanceController : to a ready replica\n(another one if it fails)
MaintenanceController -> CreateMaintenancePartUseCase : execute(...)
CreateMaintenancePartUseCase -> DBAM : part number already in the catalog?
CreateMaintenancePartUseCase -> DBAM : save maintenance part + one copy per other replica in the outbox\n(same transaction)
CreateMaintenancePartUseCase --> MaintenanceController : created
MaintenanceController --> Actor : 201 Created
OBAM -> PAM : PUT /internal/replicas/maintenance-parts\n(to every other replica, retried until delivered)
PAM --> OBAM : 200 (applied if newer)
== PATCH /api/maintenance/parts/{partNumber} ==
Actor -> EAM : PATCH /api/maintenance/parts/{partNumber}\n(HTTPS, Authorization: Bearer JWT)
EAM -> MaintenanceController : to a ready replica\n(another one if it fails)
MaintenanceController -> UpdateMaintenancePartUseCase : execute(...)
UpdateMaintenancePartUseCase -> DBAM : apply the change to this replica's copy\n+ one copy per other replica in the outbox (same transaction)
UpdateMaintenancePartUseCase --> MaintenanceController : updated
MaintenanceController --> Actor : 200 OK
OBAM -> PAM : PUT /internal/replicas/maintenance-parts\n(to every other replica; the latest change wins)
PAM --> OBAM : 200 (applied if newer)
== DELETE /api/maintenance/parts/{partNumber} ==
Actor -> EAM : DELETE /api/maintenance/parts/{partNumber}\n(HTTPS, Authorization: Bearer JWT)
EAM -> MaintenanceController : to a ready replica\n(another one if it fails)
MaintenanceController -> DeleteMaintenancePartUseCase : execute(...)
DeleteMaintenancePartUseCase -> DBAM : own maintenance records
DeleteMaintenancePartUseCase -> PAM : GET /internal/replicas/maintenance-records\n(every peer in parallel)
PAM --> DeleteMaintenancePartUseCase : their maintenance records
alt the part is used by a maintenance record
MaintenanceController --> Actor : 409 Conflict
else
DeleteMaintenancePartUseCase -> DBAM : delete + tombstone, and one deletion per other replica in the outbox\n(same transaction)
MaintenanceController --> Actor : 204 No Content
OBAM -> PAM : PUT /internal/replicas/maintenance-parts (deletion)\n(to every replica, retried until delivered)
end
== GET /api/maintenance/parts/search ==
Actor -> EAM : GET /api/maintenance/parts/search\n(HTTPS, Authorization: Bearer JWT)
EAM -> MaintenanceController : to a ready replica\n(another one if it fails)
MaintenanceController -> SearchMaintenancePartUseCase : execute(...)
SearchMaintenancePartUseCase -> DBAM : read maintenance parts
note right of DBAM : catalog: complete on every replica
DBAM --> SearchMaintenancePartUseCase : data
SearchMaintenancePartUseCase --> MaintenanceController : result
MaintenanceController --> Actor : 200 OK (X-Node-Id)
@enduml
